WEBVTT

00:01.998 --> 00:15.987
[SPEAKER_00]: Around 9 p.m. on the 4th of Well Sun, Paul Rivera walks up to the head guard of the North Gate and talks to him.

00:17.789 --> 00:18.229
[SPEAKER_00]: Rodiger.

00:18.989 --> 00:19.490
[SPEAKER_00]: He turned around.

00:19.750 --> 00:20.330
[SPEAKER_00]: Oh, sir!

00:20.830 --> 00:21.791
[SPEAKER_00]: I was wondering where you are.

00:23.172 --> 00:24.193
[SPEAKER_00]: Good thing we caught this.

00:24.373 --> 00:25.934
[SPEAKER_00]: There were some buildings around here.

00:26.694 --> 00:29.316
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes, um, don't try and stop the fire.

00:29.416 --> 00:30.497
[SPEAKER_01]: Just contain it right now.

00:31.988 --> 00:33.629
[SPEAKER_00]: We should not go into the building and pour it?

00:33.649 --> 00:37.651
[SPEAKER_01]: No, there are chemicals in there and I don't know how they would react with water.

00:38.431 --> 00:40.132
[SPEAKER_01]: Not so much when we have bigger problems on our hands.

00:41.073 --> 00:41.633
[SPEAKER_01]: All right, sir.

00:43.314 --> 00:54.960
[SPEAKER_01]: We have Scarlet or Brotherhood of the Scarlet whatever and they have set ablaze to this building and they are literally about two doors down.

00:59.080 --> 01:05.605
[SPEAKER_01]: I need all your 20 men, or however many you have, to come here and we're gonna strike force.

01:06.065 --> 01:07.667
[SPEAKER_00]: Shall we contain the flames?

01:07.747 --> 01:10.689
[SPEAKER_00]: Contain the flames right now, as quick as you possibly can.

01:11.230 --> 01:12.050
[SPEAKER_01]: Shall I get more men?

01:13.051 --> 01:14.753
[SPEAKER_01]: Send one man to get more.

01:16.674 --> 01:17.255
[SPEAKER_01]: Let them know.

01:17.315 --> 01:21.098
[SPEAKER_01]: But right now, as soon as we're done containing the flames, we need to go into that building.

01:23.115 --> 01:23.455
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes.

01:24.216 --> 01:25.317
[SPEAKER_01]: He calls over a runner.

01:25.857 --> 01:26.118
[SPEAKER_01]: Right.

01:26.598 --> 01:31.222
[SPEAKER_00]: He goes, um, go to the Harbor Gate and ask for a squad of Marines.

01:33.524 --> 01:34.024
[SPEAKER_01]: They go off.

01:34.305 --> 01:34.705
[SPEAKER_01]: Perfect.

01:36.186 --> 01:36.847
[SPEAKER_00]: Run down the road.

01:37.167 --> 01:44.814
[SPEAKER_00]: You sit there, feeling the heat of the flames, smelling the air,

01:48.297 --> 01:48.718
[SPEAKER_00]: It's hot.

01:50.419 --> 01:57.927
[SPEAKER_00]: But you stand back, and you watch the men douse out most of the flames on the buildings next to the Elquimist place.

01:58.127 --> 02:01.391
[SPEAKER_00]: And after a while, it seems that the fire sort of burns itself out.

02:01.891 --> 02:05.415
[SPEAKER_00]: There were things in there that...

02:07.376 --> 02:08.876
[SPEAKER_00]: Could have made it worse.

02:08.956 --> 02:13.878
[SPEAKER_00]: However, it doesn't seem like the old man was carrying too many dangerous items.

02:13.898 --> 02:15.038
[SPEAKER_00]: And he wasn't lazy.

02:15.538 --> 02:16.359
[SPEAKER_00]: He wasn't lazy.

02:16.639 --> 02:19.099
[SPEAKER_00]: Probably compartmentalized.

02:19.159 --> 02:22.680
[SPEAKER_00]: It wasn't like he had a giant bowl of sulfur poured out on some table.

02:25.209 --> 02:27.771
[SPEAKER_00]: Mine ended up for snorting.

02:27.851 --> 02:28.272
[SPEAKER_00]: Exactly.

02:28.332 --> 02:28.932
[SPEAKER_00]: So it's lucky.

02:29.312 --> 02:40.000
[SPEAKER_00]: And the fact that the secondary flames on the buildings of the Warren are easily put out, basically crisis averted.

02:40.461 --> 02:40.761
[SPEAKER_01]: Right.

02:42.342 --> 02:44.524
[SPEAKER_00]: So you sit there and watch as the guys do that.

02:45.304 --> 02:52.390
[SPEAKER_00]: Ten minutes go by and a group of Marines show up with the

02:55.964 --> 03:03.086
[SPEAKER_00]: And he comes up to Rodiger and goes, Sergeant Holt, sir, from the Harbor District.

03:03.787 --> 03:05.247
[SPEAKER_00]: I've been told we have renegades here.

03:06.367 --> 03:07.308
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes, sir, we do.

03:08.708 --> 03:09.168
[SPEAKER_00]: Who are you?

03:11.889 --> 03:13.410
[SPEAKER_00]: Oh, Lord Rivera.

03:14.270 --> 03:14.670
[SPEAKER_00]: Thank you.

03:16.091 --> 03:17.391
[SPEAKER_00]: I did not know you were here.

03:18.131 --> 03:18.972
[SPEAKER_00]: How can I help, sir?

03:21.192 --> 03:22.953
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, we have some

03:25.068 --> 03:26.268
[SPEAKER_01]: Whatever you want to call them.

03:26.988 --> 03:28.369
[SPEAKER_01]: Scarlet Brotherhoods or whatever.

03:28.569 --> 03:30.969
[SPEAKER_01]: They are in that building and I point to it.

03:31.530 --> 03:35.411
[SPEAKER_01]: And we need a strike force to go in there and neutralize.

03:36.571 --> 03:42.032
[SPEAKER_00]: Paul points to a stone building 200 feet into the maze.

03:42.832 --> 03:43.112
[SPEAKER_00]: Right?

03:43.132 --> 03:43.412
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

03:44.253 --> 03:48.634
[SPEAKER_00]: The men look at each other and you can tell there's fear in their eye.

03:49.154 --> 03:51.935
[SPEAKER_00]: They don't know if they want to go in to the warren.

03:52.795 --> 03:53.455
[SPEAKER_00]: Why is that?

03:54.750 --> 03:55.591
