03:55.611 --> 03:56.872
[SPEAKER_00]: Do you say that?

03:57.032 --> 03:57.373
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

03:57.713 --> 03:58.514
[SPEAKER_00]: I'm not afraid, sir.

03:58.934 --> 04:06.121
[SPEAKER_00]: And you can tell that you poked his honor, but you know these guys are scared of going in there.

04:06.341 --> 04:06.681
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay.

04:07.622 --> 04:09.203
[SPEAKER_01]: Marines, you guys will go ahead and lead the way.

04:09.304 --> 04:11.025
