04:30.176 --> 04:33.697
[SPEAKER_00]: So, they kind of look at each other, and you guys begin marching.

04:33.717 --> 04:34.658
[SPEAKER_00]: This is perfect.

04:34.778 --> 04:36.339
[SPEAKER_00]: I love- I love having this power.

04:39.661 --> 04:42.502
[SPEAKER_01]: Paul Rivero thinks to himself- Troops out the wave of my hand.

04:44.364 --> 04:44.965
[SPEAKER_00]: Go in there.

04:45.185 --> 04:47.628
