06:06.319 --> 06:06.799
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay?

06:09.343 --> 06:11.965
[SPEAKER_01]: Uh, that's gonna be 16.

06:12.265 --> 06:12.645
[SPEAKER_01]: 16?

06:13.125 --> 06:13.466
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay.

06:13.926 --> 06:19.529
[SPEAKER_00]: So, basically as you go, you tell the sergeant which way to turn.

06:19.689 --> 06:19.909
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

06:20.049 --> 06:29.615
