06:39.224 --> 06:48.307
[SPEAKER_00]: But your men file up, and probably within about two minutes, three minutes, you've made your way to the stone building, which has kind of a...

06:49.507 --> 06:55.630
[SPEAKER_00]: There are buildings up next to it, but it's got some space around it.

06:55.850 --> 07:05.513
[SPEAKER_00]: However, as you went, there were side channels and side passages, and more than once you caught a glimpse of a face looking at you.

07:06.930 --> 07:07.630
[SPEAKER_00]: In the darkness.

07:09.411 --> 07:10.932
[SPEAKER_00]: You wouldn't want to be here by yourself.

07:11.052 --> 07:17.915
[SPEAKER_00]: It's definitely good to have 30 armed sergeants coming with you.

07:18.735 --> 07:25.838
[SPEAKER_00]: Anyway, you guys get to the opening of the building and you guys are sitting there in scale.

07:25.898 --> 07:28.819
[SPEAKER_00]: These guys are all in scale mail instead of the leather.

07:29.560 --> 07:32.001
[SPEAKER_00]: The door in front of you that they went in.

07:36.526 --> 07:38.488
[SPEAKER_00]: The sergeant says, what now, sir?

07:38.688 --> 07:40.209
[SPEAKER_00]: The men kind of file around.

07:40.229 --> 07:40.970
[SPEAKER_00]: You go, shh.

07:45.914 --> 07:48.236
[SPEAKER_01]: Is there other doors that we can go enter through?

07:49.096 --> 07:50.277
[SPEAKER_01]: Not that you know or see.

07:50.698 --> 07:51.058
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay.

07:55.842 --> 07:56.803
[SPEAKER_01]: Open the door and go in.

07:57.543 --> 08:00.366
