08:09.977 --> 08:17.685
[SPEAKER_01]: Oh, and I want to pull out my shadow mask and say, we're looking for people that are wearing these.

08:18.906 --> 08:22.130
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay, don't you hold the mask out to them and say, look for these?

08:22.490 --> 08:23.351
Yeah.

08:23.371 --> 08:24.653
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay, so.

08:25.734 --> 08:27.176
[SPEAKER_01]: They're armed and they are dangerous.

09:01.643 --> 09:17.375
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay, so you guys are gonna start walking into the building and this is your sergeant and I'll do an X for them, I'll do zeros for everybody else, you'll be a triangle.

